<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's jobless rose 6.1 pct yr/yr in Sept.</title>
<headline>Portugal's jobless rose 6.1 pct yr/yr in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of registered unemployed in Portugal rose 6.1 percent year-on-year in September to 451,174 but was down 0.3 percent month-on-month, the Institute for Employment and Professional Training (IFEP) said.</p>
<p>				   Sept 96   Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p> Registered unemployed     451,174  452,738    425,432</p>
<p> Percentage change (yr/yr)  +6.1	+7.7	+9.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The IEFP does not express the number of unemployed as a percentage of the total labour force. Its figures for the number of people out of work are consistently higher than those of the National Statistics Institute (INE) -- the government's official yardstick for unemployment.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
